        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1750,
        "name": "风车菊",
        "desc": "喜好风的植物。对于崇信风、本身也如风一般爽朗自在的蒙德人而言，风车菊便是「看得见的风」。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Windwheel Aster_icon.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1543,
        "name": "蒲公英籽",
        "desc": "随风而行的细小种子。即使拔去了旅行的羽絮，其中也寄宿着远方的希望吧。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Dandelion Seed_icon.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1525,
        "name": "落落莓",
        "desc": "饱满透亮的莓果，在口中绽放出清甜的花香。在过去，守望风暴的人仅有的慰藉便是落落莓的甜蜜与对城市安宁的希望。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Valberry_icon.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1676,
        "name": "钩钩果",
        "desc": "带着勾刺的莓果，会挂在狼的毛皮上来迁徙。看见它时，仿佛能听见狼的凄嚎在林间回荡…",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Wolfhook_icon.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 10457,
        "name": "空羽蛾",
