        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1178,
        "name": "珊瑚真珠",
        "desc": "与海祇的珊瑚相伴而生的宝珠，散发着月光般的丝丝凉意。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sango Pearl_icon.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1574,
        "name": "血斛",
        "desc": "在诗文中也被称为「赤蕊」的鲜艳植物，一度在稻妻列岛绝迹，如今在战场上再度重现。传说在血腥的战场上，它们开得格外妖艳。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Dendrobium_icon.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1908,
        "name": "鸣草",
        "desc": "即使在无风的日子里，亦会随雷鸣之声隐隐振动的植物。看起来像是花瓣的结构其实是叶片的延伸，保护着脆弱的花朵。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Naku Weed_icon.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2681,
        "name": "树王圣体菇",
        "desc": "<p>[版本1]</p><p>如云海般层层叠叠生长的菌类，大多寄生于雨林深处的乔木之上，因此被须弥人视为树王遗德熏结而出的圣体。</p><p></p><p>[版本2]</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 224, 75)\">完成魔神任务第三章•第五幕：虚空鼓动，劫火高扬</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 224, 75)\">任务 - 意识之舟所至之处</span></p><p></p><p>如云海般层层叠叠生长的菌类，大多寄生于雨林深处的乔木之上。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/08/30/36540823/fbfb9632c9668ce46422fa5b2acb9f0d_6471856161561035152.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2714,
        "name": "劫波莲",
        "desc": "<p>生长在山崖峭壁之上的攀援植物开出的花朵。被称为莲只是因为外形相似，本身和莲花并没有什么关系。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/10/47826599/b34bf1d89d2aeab8a2642c978545f013_628775777702434549.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2680,
        "name": "月莲",
        "desc": "<p>生长于林中湿地，散发着同月亮一般皎洁光芒的花卉。只有在夜晚才会绽放。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/08/30/47826599/3863df20ca44d44f23d9d781a83d5436_5633289802412126590.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2713,
        "name": "帕蒂沙兰",
        "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">圣洁而高贵的花卉，对生长环境的要求十分苛刻。花蕊经过加工后可以制成珍贵的香料。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/11/7998136/d5172558c50dbc305ee422b95bf8ed21_4672434247374916678.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2852,
        "name": "圣金虫",
        "desc": "<p>栖息在浩瀚沙海之中的顽强甲虫。甲壳上的金色纹路似乎暗示着它们与遍布沙漠的古老遗迹间存在某种渊源。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/29/47826599/eaf09e095a8a635068a4941c16528ba8_4160918546728843839.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2853,
        "name": "赤念果",
        "desc": "<p>在恶劣的沙漠环境中也能存活的植物所结的果子，赤红的果实在黄沙映村下显得格外动人。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/29/47826599/81d8b830b0d226ec9d21dacf766a78ac_8716275870424128060.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3699,
        "name": "悼灵花",
        "desc": "<p>绽放在古老战场上的鲜红之花，即便在荒漠中也能顽强生长。低垂的花朵似乎是在哀悼曾在此牺牲的英灵。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/18/47826599/8575e1578b07174e5ba20838587feb1c_2357485452092221395.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3453,
        "name": "沙脂蛹",
        "desc": "<p>在沙漠深处流沙鳗鳗的繁殖地才能找到的枯壳。其坚硬的表壳是为了保护流沙鳗鳗的幼体，直到它们得以适应炎热干燥的沙漠环境而存在的。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/01/18/36540823/68a5eb3d0efa30c8749611ef1ce80d6c_6100883501498223936.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3700,
        "name": "万相石",
        "desc": "<p>分布在荒原群山的深处，散发着异彩的特殊辉石，似乎是由混化的元素能量凝结而成的。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/18/47826599/d5aa11664a9dbda41d73ec3568059c4c_3843308247359435594.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4574,
        "name": "湖光铃兰",
        "desc": "<p><span>明澈而澄净的苍色花卉。生于水脉汇聚之处，其香清冷淡雅，辛凉柔婉。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/11/10/327628065/c43e2d148b98d58c98a008b13e37b5b5_3444351177978722120.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4007,
        "name": "虹彩蔷薇",
        "desc": "<p><span>纤婉而柔洁的粉色花卉。虽然被称作蔷薇，但本质上更接近百合。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/18/88072335/670b8958c90014a1bdacba5123c2c9da_1658979066409504343.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4008,
        "name": "海露花",
        "desc": "<p><span>幽淡而高贵的蓝色花卉。柔软的花蕊具备良好的吸水性和弹性，是诸多日用品的原材料。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/18/88072335/d6429603c5f355d6722a5530c558e499_8763519200832133812.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4009,
        "name": "柔灯铃",
        "desc": "<p><span>静雅而清美的紫色花卉。其香清淡悠长、细腻柔和，因此常被用来制作名贵的香水。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/18/88072335/8c0e01560c70f5fc56e6719ae809d415_3174462674425518385.png",
        "amount": 15,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
